                 {
                   "type": "instructions",
                   "value": [
                     "Use this information to enhance the draft.\n\n",
                     "The role is 'Complainant & Defendant', or 'Claimant & Defendant' use if not specify.\n\n",
                     "If 'PartyOneRole' is a claimant, then it is a civil matter, it becomes 'SUIT NO:__'.\n\n",
